category: Libs
build-depends: cygport gettext-devel libiconv-devel libintl-devel libreadline-devel libxml2-devel ocaml ocaml-findlib python3-devel
sdesc: "Read and write Windows Registry binary hive files (utilities)"
ldesc: "Hive files are the undocumented binary files that Windows uses to
store the Windows Registry on disk.  Hivex is a library that can read
and write to these files."
